label story_04_fail (Echoes Beneath the Stones Failed)
[style name="Gameplay"]
"Dianthus Core" (Default): Veld's echoes have turned away from us. The stones no longer answer when I reach for them.
"Dianthus Core": The Weavers will finish their door in the dark, and we must live with whatever steps through it. That is the cost of time we did not have.
"Dianthus Core": Do not spend your strength on regret, little alchemist. Regret does not grow roots. Plant, forge, and keep the Core breathing through the nights that remain.
